---
import LegalPage from "@/components/effect-days/LegalPage.astro"
import LegalClause from "@/components/effect-days/LegalClause.astro"
import InlineLink from "@/components/effect-days/InlineLink.astro"
---

<LegalPage
  title="Code of Conduct - Effect Days"
  description="Our commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all attendees at Effect Days"
  heading="Code of Conduct"
>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
      Effect Days is dedicated to providing a safe, inclusive, and welcoming environment for all
      participants.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
      We are committed to creating a conference experience that promotes learning, collaboration,
      and the open exchange of ideas. By attending Effect Days, you agree to abide by the following
      guidelines to help us achieve this goal:
    </p>
  </div>

  <LegalClause
    title="1. Respect for all attendees"
    body="Treat all participants with respect and kindness, regardless of their background, identity, or experience level. This includes, but is not limited to: age, disability, ethnicity, gender identity and expression, nationality, personal appearance, race, religion, or sexual orientation."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="2. Inclusive and welcoming environment"
    body="Strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels welcome and valued. Be mindful of language and actions that could be exclusionary or offensive, and be open to feedback and learning."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="3. Collaboration and learning"
    body="Embrace the spirit of collaboration and learning. Share your knowledge, ask questions, and engage in constructive discussions. Remember that everyone is here to grow and learn from each other."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="4. Privacy and consent"
    body="Respect the privacy of others. Do not photograph, record, or share personal information about other attendees without their explicit consent."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="5. Compliance with venue rules"
    body="Follow all rules and guidelines of the conference venue. This includes adhering to safety regulations and respecting the property of the venue and other attendees."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="6. Professionalism"
    body="Maintain a professional demeanor at all times. Refrain from engaging in any form of harassment, discrimination, or inappropriate behavior. This includes verbal comments, physical actions, and electronic communications."
  />
  <LegalClause title="7. Reporting violations">
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      If you witness or experience any behavior that violates this Code of Conduct, please report it
      immediately to the conference organizers. We take all reports seriously and will take
      appropriate action to address the situation.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      You can report issues by contacting any staff member (identifiable by their staff badges) or
      by emailing{" "}
      <InlineLink href="mailto:contact@effectful.co">contact@effectful.co</InlineLink>.
    </p>
  </LegalClause>
  <LegalClause
    title="8. Consequences"
    body="Violations of this Code of Conduct may result in consequences including, but not limited to, a warning, expulsion from the conference without refund, or being banned from future events."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="9. Supportive community"
    body="Be an ally to those who may need support. If you see someone who is uncomfortable or in need of assistance, offer your help or alert the conference staff."
  />
  <LegalClause
    title="10. Code of conduct changes"
    body="The conference organizers reserve the right to update or modify this Code of Conduct at any time. Any changes will be communicated to all attendees."
  />

  <div class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-800 pt-12">
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
      By participating in Effect Days, you agree to abide by this Code of Conduct and help us create
      a positive and memorable experience for all attendees. Thank you for your cooperation and
      commitment to making this event a success.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      This Code of Conduct is inspired by{" "}
      <InlineLink href="https://config.figma.com/coc">Config by Figma</InlineLink>{" "}
      and{" "}
      <InlineLink href="https://www.reason-conf.com/code-of-conduct">
        ReasonConf by Nikolaus Graf
      </InlineLink>.
    </p>
  </div>
</LegalPage>
